<item name='HFText'><text>No</text></item>
<item name='HelpECategories'><text>2. Database Custodian Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>2. Guide de gardien de base de données</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>5</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>2</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='75%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>The Project documents have 2 purposes:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	1.  To keep track of project budget information.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	2.  To control access to orders/projects.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>In order to create a Project:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.0021in' rightmargin='75%' firstlineleftmargin='0.8118in'/>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>0. In the Financial Coding 1 view, add your project name as a new document (or make sure it already exists)</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.  From the Admin section of the database, click on "Projects" in the navigator, and then click the "New Project" button in the action bar.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
