<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Updating the Budget:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>If, for any reason, the budget information here does not match the dollar amounts for the project in the Order Form section of the database, you can re-calculate the budget by clicking on the </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>"Recalculate Budget" </run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>button in the action bar.  The Orders database will then total the orders and adjust the amount committed accordingly.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>NOTE: then you have to go to financial coding 2 and add the project in each category!</run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpFHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='75%'/>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par></richtext></item>
